# Computer Series, 42.

**Authors:** Moore, John W., Ed.

## Abstract
Eleven separate reports on computer programs (with sources indicated) and related materials are presented. These include chemical applications of interactive function translator, numerical optimization on microcomputer, Apple pH meter, axes-drawing program for Hewlett-Packard digital plotters, inexpensive chart recorder for freshmen laboratory, personal literature retrieval system, and others. (JN)

